-a810-c036719153d1","186d3887-d57d-518c-8047-657e5a903910","b0800b3c-70f2-50b2-8e70-7cbd5de44ad5","df8099f0-944d-55ec-91b1-0749eb029a12","ef362388-e683-5a47-8f4f-3c27be6a25af","60181f33-96db-5fea-8bea-bebdbbdc8e79","b7f3405d-0d63-5019-9d4e-701758ef7085","13fca7e3-961f-5ac6-8ef8-3ba8572e82e1","91f598d4-83f8-57f6-8652-8af3ddaa69e3","69bf0924-edf5-5b24-a1ef-8546970a1b27"]},{"name":"slot_door","origin":[0.0,0.0,-44.0],"color":0,"uuid":"d5c4c483-63e1-5335-9091-30d1e6ff4628","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":false,"locked":false,"visibility":true,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":[]},{"name":"slot_dropoff","origin":[0.0,0.0,-44.0],"color":0,"uuid":"bc316134-e295-54e4-90f9-ca42b377e3d1","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":false,"locked":false,"visibility":true,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":[]}]}],"textures":[{"path":"storehouse.png","name":"storehouse.png","folder":"","namespace":"","id":"0","width":512,"height":512,"uv_width":512,"uv_height":512,"particle":false,"use_as_default":true,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"58418896-a34e-5bdc-bf86-74b0598e4e60","relative_path":"storehouse.png","source":"data:image/png;base64,"}],"animations":[],"description":"# storehouse\n\nStorehouse: a plain, sturdy barn with wide double doors, barrels and sacks stacked out front.\n\n- Footprint: 9 x 7 columns (144 x 112 units, 4.05 x 3.15 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -70..70, y 0..131, z -52..52 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 55, construction_0 26, construction_33 36, construction_66 42, ruined 27 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 128 x 132 x 80 centred at x 0, z 8\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `storehouse_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `storehouse_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_storehouse` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -44)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (0, 0, -44)\n"}